#   1. Copy .env.example → .env + JIRA_EMAIL + JIRA_API_TOKEN
#   2. Cursor MCP: release-orchestrator + playwright + teams (see daily_review_mcp_config)
#   3. Chat: use glofox → crew done
#   4. Playwright: one-time Slack web + M365 sign-in (Step 6 + SharePoint + review calls)
